## Catalog JSON contracts

Tenant authors import catalogs that must match:

- `docs/reference/entity-definition.md`
- `docs/reference/entity-query-definition.md`
- `docs/reference/metric-definition.md`
- `docs/reference/data-hook-definition.md`
- `docs/reference/custom-view-definition.md`

Platform code validates against shared Zod schemas — do not invent parallel shapes.

## AI / async

- Enqueue AI jobs only after spend guards; use Cloud Tasks clients / local dispatch as documented in `docs/ai-platform/05-api-worker-ui.md`.
- New async triggers: register in workload registry (`AGENTS.md`).

## Enforcement

- `pnpm --filter api test` / `typecheck` / `lint`
- ESLint: no `firebase-admin/firestore` in apps
- `pnpm check:prod-runtime` when changing esbuild externals / Dockerfile

